# BANDIT ROOST — the structure at a mid-band bandit spawn site (charter §4:
# "the player can point at where enemies come from, and stop them").
#
# A hanging dock: a hull deck slung under two gasbags, a turret on the beam,
# a strut mast, and a door into the crew hole. It never flies — the world
# freezes it in place — so the gasbags are read as what holds it up rather
# than as lift the physics needs.
#
# Preview it without booting the game:
#
#   godot --headless --path . --script tools/ship_preview.gd -- ships/nest_roost.ship
#
#   G  gasbag (the canopy)      #  hull      T  turret
#   |  strut (the mast)         D  door      -  platform (the landing deck)
#
# Keep it ONE connected piece: a nest is destroyed by taking half of it apart,
# and a detached wing would fall away as its own wreck instead.

origin 5 3

..GGGGGG..
.GGGGGGGG.
..GGGGGG..
....||....
..######..
.##D##T##.
.--------.
